  Description: A unit of Crimson Reclaimers saved you from certain death in the Gravelands.
    You spent time with one or more Crimson Reclaimers as they escorted you to safety,
    and you've learned the ways of this faction of the Knights of Lastwall. You consider
    yourself forever in their debt and defend their reputation unquestioningly against
    any accusations of duplicity. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution
    or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Intimidation
    skill and the Crimson Reclaimers Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group
    Coercion] skill feat.
